Problem specification
---------------------

The problem solved here — "16 - Trucks problem" — is an assignment from the
Constraint Programming course held by Prof. Alessandro Dal Palù at the
University of Parma, and its wording is his work.

The assignment sheet is NOT redistributed here, and its text is not reproduced
verbatim anywhere in this repository. The problem is restated in the authors'
own words wherever it is needed — in README.md, in the opening section of the
report, and in the header comments of the models. None of those is a
transcription of the assignment. Readers who need the original wording should
obtain it from the course.


